1 0 obj<</Author(MalachiWalker)/CreationDate(D:20261101021522+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Teen And Up Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Bow \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\) \(briefly\), Frustrated artists, Not-so subtle critiques of the music industry, Gratuitous abuse of italics, Adora curses about as much as Catra, She and Glimmer both have repressed anger issues, And some subtle shade thrown at Light Hope for good measure, Also hope you're ready to wax lyrical about music, "Fellas is is gay to see your disappeared ex on TV and immediately lose your shit", "After ten years and five pages of relentlessly pining for her", allusions to Shadow Weaver's A+ Parenting, F/F, No Archive Warnings Apply, Hurt/Comfort, Serious Injuries, Flashbacks to said serious injuries, Some discussion of ableism, Introducing 'No Chill Catradora', Along with Chaos Gremlin Glimmer, Now with an actual rock concert!, Reminiscing over shared experiences before taking a hard left into the Feels’, -sax solo- REUNITED AND IT FEELS SO GOOD!)/ModDate(D:20261101021522+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(I Thought I Was Just Haunted \(Then I Saw You On My TV Screen\))>>
